---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="How to Join | Irvington FBLA" description="Ready to start your business journey? Learn how to join Irvington FBLA, requirements, and membership details.">
	<section class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Join Irvington FBLA</h1>
			<p>Start your journey to becoming a future business leader</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="text-content">
				<h2>Membership Requirements</h2>
				<p>Irvington FBLA welcomes all students who are interested in business, leadership, and personal growth. To become an official member, you must:</p>
				<ol>
					<li><strong>Be an Irvington High School Student:</strong> Membership is open to all grade levels (9-12).</li>
					<li><strong>Enroll in a CTE Course (Recommended):</strong> While we have the LOOP pathway for non-CTE students, being in a Career Technical Education (CTE) course unlocks the full FBLA experience, including competitions. <a href="/pathways/cte">Learn more about CTE courses</a>.</li>
					<li><strong>Pay Membership Dues:</strong> Dues cover state and national affiliation fees, as well as chapter activities. Check the Viking Vendor or announcements for current pricing.</li>
					<li><strong>Fill out the Membership Form:</strong> Complete the official registration form to be added to our roster.</li>
				</ol>

				<h2>Steps to Join</h2>
				
				<h3>Step 1: Attend a Meeting</h3>
				<p>Come to one of our general meetings to learn more about the club, meet the officers, and see what we're all about. Meetings are typically held in Norse Hall. Listen to the daily announcements for dates and times.</p>
				
				<h3>Step 2: Choose Your Pathway</h3>
				<p>Decide if you are joining through the <strong>CTE Pathway</strong> (for students in CTE classes) or the <strong>LOOP Pathway</strong> (for non-CTE students). Both pathways offer amazing opportunities, but competition eligibility varies.</p>
				
				<h3>Step 3: Register & Pay Dues</h3>
				<p>Visit the Viking Vendor online or in-person to pay your membership dues. Once paid, make sure to complete the online registration form provided by the officers.</p>
				
				<h2>Member Benefits</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Official Membership Card:</strong> Recognized nationally.</li>
					<li><strong>Competition Eligibility:</strong> Qualify for Regional, State, and National competitions (CTE members).</li>
					<li><strong>Workshop Access:</strong> Attend exclusive workshops on public speaking, resume building, and more.</li>
					<li><strong>Social Events:</strong> Join us for chapter bondings, banquets, and other fun activities.</li>
					<li><strong>FBLA Magazine:</strong> Receive the national Tomorrow's Business Leader publication.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Questions?</h2>
				<p>If you have any questions about joining, feel free to <a href="/#contact">contact us</a> or reach out to any officer on campus.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0052cc 0%, #003366 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: white;
		opacity: 1;
	}

	.content-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
	}

	.text-content {
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	h2 {
		color: #003366;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-size: 2rem;
	}
	
	h3 {
		color: #0052cc;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}

	p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}

	ul, ol {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}
	
	strong {
		color: #1f2937;
	}
	
	a {
		color: #0052cc;
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
</style>